        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    participant Dev as Dev / main branch\n    participant CI as ci.yml\n    participant GHCR as GHCR\n    participant CD as cd.yml (workflow_dispatch)\n    participant AWS as AWS Academy (creds temp.)\n    participant EKS as Cluster EKS\n    participant K8s as Namespace workshop\n \n    Dev-&gt;&gt;CI: push na main\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: build + testes + coverage (mvnw verify)\n    CI-&gt;&gt;GHCR: push imagem (sha-&lt;sha&gt; / latest)\n \n    Note over CD: disparo manual com image_tag\n    CD-&gt;&gt;CD: valida secrets (AWS + DB_HOST)\n    CD-&gt;&gt;AWS: configure-aws-credentials (temporárias)\n    CD-&gt;&gt;EKS: aws eks update-kubeconfig\n    CD-&gt;&gt;K8s: cria namespace \&quot;workshop\&quot;\n    CD-&gt;&gt;K8s: cria/atualiza Secret workshop-secret\n    CD-&gt;&gt;CD: injeta DB_HOST (RDS) no config.env\n    CD-&gt;&gt;K8s: kubectl apply -k overlays/aws\n    CD-&gt;&gt;K8s: set image deployment (tag imutável)\n    K8s--&gt;&gt;CD: rollout status (aguarda pods prontos)\n    CD--&gt;&gt;Dev: URL pública do ELB&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="EETkzEuI28K15EruteyI-1">
